ent Description:Time	Activity
2.00 pm	Welcome and Introduction
	- Brief introduction to the session and its purpose
	- Overview of the Knimbus platform and its benefits
2:10 pm	Session 1: Introduction to Knimbus Subscribed Resources
	- Overview of available resources and how to access them
	- Demonstration of platform features and functionalities
2:30 pm	Session 2: Best Practices for Using Knimbus
	- Tips and tricks for effective resource management
	- Search techniques, saving resources, and managing access
2:50 pm	Q&amp;A Session
	- Open floor for participants to ask questions
3:10 pm	Session 3: Advanced Features of Knimbus
	- Exploring advanced search features and analytical tools
	- How Knimbus can enhance academic and research productivity
3:40 pm	Closing Remarks
	- Final thoughts, thank you note, and feedback invitation
	- Information on how to contact Knimbus for support
4:00 pm	End of Webinar</p>
